FOREWORD 
This report was progressively documented to capture all activities during the entire 
Census preparation and operation.  The report may be used for future Census 
preparatory work as a resource to support the implementation of various activities for 
the entire operation of the project.  The set-up of the core Census internal committee 
was on the 2 nd of February, 2016.  Nine subcommittees were then instituted for the 
management of work processes. They were the; 
1. Mapping
2. Budget
3. Human resource
4. Questionnaire design
5. Publicity
6. Training
7. Pu rchase and Equipment (IT)
8. Data processing
9. Data analysis & dissemination
Documented by: The Household Survey Unit 
Written by:  The Census Project Manager/Coordinator 
Edited by:  The Census Commissioner (Government Statistician) 
Please address all comments to Mr. Epeli Waqavonovono (epeliw@statfiji.gov.fj) 
