Objectives 
 
The key objectives of the Census Questionnaire Design Team were to; 
 
1. ensure a formal standardised questionnaire is well designed, in advance, through 
consultations  
2. ensure that the design of the questionnaire meets the Census objectives in 
obtaining the most complete and accurate information possible  
3. formulate prescribed definitions or explanations for each question for clarity during 
interviews 
4. ensure that the questions are piloted by working together with the IT team 
 
